#: mainwindow.cpp:316
msgid ""
"Do you want to fire the ball on mouse click?\n"
"Answering Yes will make the game steal the\n"
"mouse cursor, pause the game to get\n"
"the cursor back."
msgstr ""
"Queres disparar a bóla premendo co rato?\n"
"De contestares Si, o xogo rouba o\n"
"botón do rato; detén o xogo para\n"
"retomar o cursor."

#: mainwindow.cpp:320
